# HP39gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# Start the lazy HPGCC/APLET transfer early, then wait for the evidence-based
# worst-case Kermit envelope before issuing exactly one final launch ENTER.
# Unlike canonical runtime E2E, do not keep retrying ENTER after launch: ENTER
# is a Gallery page toggle once the payload is running.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk
13300 tap enter
31000 capture remote-aplet
32500 tap enter
34000 capture lazy-fetch

# Monitor the result word throughout transfer and Gallery execution. HP39gs
# has previously made valid Kermit progress close to 400 s, so keep the same
# bounded envelope but launch only after it has had ample time to finish.
34500 monitor 450000
410000 tap enter
425000 capture native-mini
428000 tap down
431000 capture native-main
434000 tap right
437000 capture generated-control
440000 tap on
